  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 17 is the longest at Flying Armadillo at 590 feet — a par 4 that stretches across the best of the hill country and gives the Big Course its one true two-shot moment. From the blue tees it's a big drive and a bigger approach, with the Texas views making the walk worth every stroke.",
  "localTips": "Pay at the pro shop — this is a private, pay-to-play club with three courses, so plan a full day. The blue tees are the long loop at 5,800 feet. Camping is on site, and the mini course is worth the detour for the gimmick holes.",
